IVE_TO_EIGHT"],"5 到 8 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiC9aynu9KWAxUwU_UHHQx6C-sQ3YcHCJMBKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiC9aynu9KWAxUwU_UHHQx6C-sQ3IcHCJIBKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["很受歡迎的一家店，跟家人一起來品嚐美味😋\n\n菜單品項很簡單，拉麵更是只有兩種選擇，濃郁的雞湯白湯拉麵、我們當天有限定款的醬油雞湯拉麵\n我們各點不同的試試，另外加點了鴨胸叉燒飯\n\n雞白濃湯～顧名思義，湯頭真的很濃郁，加上一點酸的小柚子中合了濃郁的膩感，叉燒肉片有三種，雞肉片、豬肉片、鴨肉片都各給二片，肉質都鮮美好吃！\n\n限定的醬油湯～清澈的湯底，鹹度中帶點味甜，加點小柚子讓湯的鹹甜更明顯！\n\n麵條是細麵，很Q彈，讓人一口接一口！\n\n鴨胸叉燒飯～米飯Q軟，米粒分明，所淋的醬汁包覆著米飯，亦是讓人一口接一口，肉質軟嫩，特殊的炙燒與醬汁，讓這碗飯蠻特別的，可以嘗試這不同於一般的鴨肉飯！",null,[0,66]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12028219985502106725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXTVZReVJsVlZWbkJOVjFkV1FsbDZUakZpYm5CcVlWVk9VVlJ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12028219985502106725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXTVZReVJsVlZWbkJOVjFkV1FsbDZUakZpYm5CcVlWVk9VVlJ0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12028219985502106725/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXTVZReVJsVlZWbkJOVjFkV1FsbDZUakZpYm5CcVlWVk9VVlJ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12028219985502106725/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXTVZReVJsVlZWbkJOVjFkV1FsbDZUakZpYm5CcVlWVk9VVlJ0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12028219985502106725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXTVZReVJsVlZWbkJOVjFkV1FsbDZUakZpYm5CcVlWVk9VVlJ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12028219985502106725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXTVZReVJsVlZWbkJOVjFkV1FsbDZUakZpYm5CcVlWVk9VVlJ0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4163,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WMVQyRlVVVnBNV1dWQll6TjFibnBqYVVOUVRtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa3a5e20306ade7c2!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnV1T2FUUVpMWWVBYzN1bnpjaUNQTmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["h